[{"id":3085517468,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc636UKc","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"I can't properly review the code, but I tested locally and confirmed this fixes the issue with leaking the local rendering device and it doesn't appear to change the code completion recommendations for any of the code I tested\r\n\r\nI suspect a lot of the perceived instability of Godot when working with advanced rendering features comes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109193, so I believe that this PR will be a huge step forward in the perceived stability of Godot for advanced users","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109297#pullrequestreview-3085517468","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109297","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-04T19:38:01Z"},{"id":3085958897,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc637_7x","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nI think the \"static declaration\" approach for autocompletion of dictionaries returned by Engine methods makes sense. It's likely the best we can do while keeping autocompletion's behavior as static as possible.\r\n\r\nThis PR will probably also help with performance a little when working in the code editor, at least on the power usage/battery life front.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109297#pullrequestreview-3085958897","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109297","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-04T22:28:05Z"},{"id":3090607540,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64Nu20","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"97b1bc6bdabd866e56158442934f7b662af3d08a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109297#pullrequestreview-3090607540","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109297","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-06T06:40:05Z"},{"id":3091317051,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64QcE7","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"97b1bc6bdabd866e56158442934f7b662af3d08a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url"